            "type": "completion",
            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 1–10</h3><p>Complete the table below.</p><p>Write <strong>ONE WORD AND/OR A NUMBER</strong> for each answer.</p>",
            "selectCount": 1,
            "maxWords": 2,
            "bodyHtml": "<div class=\"summary\"><div class=\"summary-title\">Local councils can arrange practical support to help those caring for elderly people at home.</div>\n<p class=\"sub-head\">This can give the carer:</p>\n<ul class=\"notes-list\"><li>time for other responsibilities</li><li>a {{1}}</li></ul>\n<p class=\"sub-head\">Assessment of mother's needs</p>\n<p>This may include discussion of:</p>\n<ul class=\"notes-list\"><li>how much {{2}} the caring involves</li></ul>\n<p class=\"sub-head\">What types of tasks are involved, e.g.:</p>\n<ul class=\"notes-list\"><li>help with dressing</li><li>helping her have a {{3}}</li><li>shopping</li><li>helping with meals</li><li>dealing with {{4}}</li></ul>\n<p class=\"sub-head\">Any aspects of caring that are especially difficult, e.g.:</p>\n<ul class=\"notes-list\"><li>loss of {{5}}</li><li>{{6}} her</li><li>preventing a {{7}}</li></ul>\n<p class=\"sub-head\">Types of support that may be offered to carers</p>\n<ul class=\"notes-list\"><li>transport costs, e.g. cost of a {{8}}</li><li>car-related costs, e.g. fuel and {{9}}</li><li>help with housework</li><li>help to reduce {{10}}</li></ul></div>"
          }
        ]
      },
