            "selectCount": 1,
            "rubricHtml": "<h3>Questions 21–25</h3><p>What is Rosie and Colin's opinion about each of the following aspects of human geography?</p><p>Choose <strong>FIVE</strong> answers from the box and write the correct letter, <strong>A–G</strong>, next to Questions 21–25.</p>",
